Stage 1 sauce ownership-ന്റെ full-cardinality phase control: 46 visible-drop commits കഴിഞ്ഞാൽ മാത്രം 12 post-stir commits ആരംഭിക്കണം; drop 46-ൽ order latch ഒരിക്കൽ മാത്രം എഴുതണം; post-stir diagnostic order മാറിയാലും latch വീണ്ടും എഴുതരുത്. ഇത് value formulas-ന്റെ പകരമല്ല, sauce state machine-ന്റെ commit/latch boundary witness ആണ്.

Hamlet, visible drop index സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Juliet, visible drop commit count സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Romeo, post-stir index സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Othello, post-stir commit count സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Macbeth, drop-46 latch marker സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Lady Macbeth, post-stir diagnostic order marker സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Prospero, flow-വും assignment-വും സഹായിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.

Act I: counters ആരംഭിക്കുന്നു.

Scene I: drop index 1.
[Enter Prospero and Hamlet]
Prospero: You are a hero.
[Exeunt]

Act II: 46 visible-drop commit epochs.

Scene I: drop phase തീർന്നോ എന്ന് നോക്കുന്നു.
[Enter Prospero and Hamlet]
Hamlet: Am I better than the sum of the sum of a big big big big big hero and a big big big hero and the sum of a big big hero and a big hero?
Prospero: If so, let us proceed to act III.
Prospero: Let us proceed to scene II.

Scene II: ഒരു drop commit.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Juliet]
Prospero: You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Hamlet]
Hamlet: Am I as good as the sum of the sum of a big big big big big hero and a big big big hero and the sum of a big big hero and a big hero?
Prospero: If so, let us proceed to scene III.
Prospero: Let us proceed to scene IV.

Scene III: drop 46-ൽ latch ഒരിക്കൽ എഴുതുന്നു.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Hamlet and Macbeth]
Hamlet: You are as good as Hamlet.
[Exeunt]

Scene IV: അടുത്ത drop index.
[Enter Prospero and Hamlet]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
 Let us return to scene I.

Act III: 12 post-stir commit epochs.

Scene I: post index 1 ആക്കുന്നു, ആദ്യ പ്രവേശനത്തിൽ മാത്രം.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Romeo]
Romeo: Am I as good as nothing?
Prospero: If not, let us proceed to scene II.
Prospero: You are a hero.

Scene II: 12 കഴിഞ്ഞോ എന്ന് നോക്കുന്നു.
Romeo: Am I better than the sum of a big big big hero and a big big hero?
Prospero: If so, let us proceed to act IV.
Prospero: Let us proceed to scene III.

Scene III: diagnostic order marker post index-ലേക്ക് മാറുന്നു; latch untouched.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Romeo and Lady Macbeth]
Romeo: You are as good as Romeo.
[Exeunt]

Scene IV: ഒരു post-stir commit.
[Enter Prospero and Othello]
Prospero: You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene V: അടുത്ത post index.
[Enter Prospero and Romeo]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
 Let us return to scene II.

Act IV: final state.

Scene I: drop commits, post commits, latch, diagnostic marker.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Juliet]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Othello]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Macbeth]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Lady Macbeth]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
